WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.767 --> 00:00:01.801
HEY, ALL I KNOW 
IS THAT IT'S GOOD

00:00:01.835 --> 00:00:03.703
HAVING ANOTHER BROTHER
MOVE INTO THE NEIGHBORHOOD.

00:00:03.736 --> 00:00:05.505
- HEY, MAN, IT'S GOOD
TO HAVE YOU OVER.

00:00:05.538 --> 00:00:07.073
AND I THINK
THAT YOU WILL DIG THIS.

00:00:07.106 --> 00:00:10.243
- ALL RIGHT.

00:00:10.276 --> 00:00:12.211
HEY!
- HUH?

00:00:12.244 --> 00:00:13.780
- NICE GUITAR COLLECTION.
- OH, THANKS, MAN.

00:00:13.813 --> 00:00:16.215
HEY, YOU WANNA HEAR SOMETHING?

00:00:16.248 --> 00:00:18.117
- YEAH, SURE.
- ALL RIGHT, ALL RIGHT.

00:00:18.150 --> 00:00:19.519
ALL RIGHT,
LET'S GET THIS STARTED.

00:00:19.552 --> 00:00:20.653
LET'S GET THIS STARTED.

00:00:20.686 --> 00:00:22.722
[playing guitar]

00:00:22.755 --> 00:00:25.558
♪ WELL, I'M JUST
A GOOD OLD AMERICAN BOY ♪

00:00:25.591 --> 00:00:30.396
♪ WITH A HEART
THAT'S RED, WHITE, AND TRUE ♪

00:00:30.429 --> 00:00:32.765
♪ I'M DREAMIN' OF THE GIRL
WITH THE RED HAIR AND FRECKLES ♪

00:00:32.798 --> 00:00:35.835
♪ AND HER EYES LIKE
THE SKIES OF BLUE ♪

00:00:35.868 --> 00:00:37.770
- COUNTRY MUSIC.

00:00:37.803 --> 00:00:39.072
- YEAH, I GREW UP IN TEXAS.
YOU KNOW, SO...

00:00:39.105 --> 00:00:41.107
- ALL RIGHT.

00:00:41.140 --> 00:00:42.642
- ♪ KEEP HER SAFE
FROM THE HOMIES ♪

00:00:42.675 --> 00:00:44.844
♪ IN THE WRONG SIDE
OF TOWN ♪

00:00:44.877 --> 00:00:48.481
♪ WHERE THEY'RE SMOKIN' THE
REEFER AND ACTING LIKE CLOWNS ♪

00:00:48.514 --> 00:00:51.317
♪ KEEP THAT PRETTY WHITE DRESS
FROM GETTING DIRTY AND BROWN ♪

00:00:51.350 --> 00:00:53.686
♪ 'CAUSE THAT'S
THE AMERICAN WAY ♪

00:00:56.689 --> 00:00:58.257
WOO-HOO!

00:00:58.290 --> 00:01:00.359
- WHOA.

00:01:00.392 --> 00:01:01.527
PRETTY RACIST SONG.

00:01:01.560 --> 00:01:03.129
[both laugh]

00:01:03.162 --> 00:01:05.364
- RACIST?
AGAINST WHO?

00:01:05.397 --> 00:01:07.333
- BLACK PEOPLE.
- BLACK PEOPLE?

00:01:07.366 --> 00:01:09.202
BUT I'M BLACK.
[laughs]

00:01:09.235 --> 00:01:11.471
- WELL, KEEPING
THE REDHEADED GIRL AWAY

00:01:11.504 --> 00:01:13.172
FROM THE HOMIES
ON THE WRONG SIDE OF TOWN?

00:01:13.205 --> 00:01:15.174
- HOMIES?

00:01:15.207 --> 00:01:16.809
COME ON, BROTHER.
THERE'S ALL KINDS OF HOMIES.

00:01:16.842 --> 00:01:20.179
YOU KNOW, WHITE HOMIES,
ASIAN HOMIES.

00:01:20.212 --> 00:01:22.115
- NO, HOMIES ARE BLACK.

00:01:22.148 --> 00:01:23.416
- NO, I THINK YOU'RE
MAKING THEM BLACK, MAN.

00:01:23.449 --> 00:01:25.585
I THINK THAT'S YOUR STUFF.

00:01:25.618 --> 00:01:28.888
YOU HEAR THE TWANG AND THEN
YOU ASSUME THAT IT'S RACIST.

00:01:28.921 --> 00:01:31.357
BUT THAT'S JUST
WHAT COUNTRY MUSIC IS LIKE.

00:01:31.390 --> 00:01:33.159
HERE, LOOK, YOU'RE
GONNA LIKE THIS ONE.

00:01:33.192 --> 00:01:34.827
YOU'LL LIKE THIS ONE.
- ALL RIGHT.

00:01:34.860 --> 00:01:37.263
- [playing guitar]

00:01:37.296 --> 00:01:40.166
♪ SOME FOLKS WEAR THEIR HATS
WAY OFF TO THE SIDE ♪

00:01:40.199 --> 00:01:43.136
♪ WITH THEIR PANTS DOWN LOW
AND A GUN TUCKED INSIDE ♪

00:01:43.169 --> 00:01:46.139
♪ TAKE THEIR BEER BY THE 40
AND THEIR CHICKEN DEEP-FRIED ♪

00:01:46.172 --> 00:01:50.776
♪ I THINK WE ALL KNOW
WHO WE'RE TALKING ABOUT ♪

00:01:50.809 --> 00:01:53.513
♪ THE ONLY DARK I LIKE
IS WHEN I TURN OFF THE LIGHTS ♪

00:01:53.546 --> 00:01:56.782
♪ THE ONLY HOOD I LOVE
IS POINTY AND WHITE ♪

00:01:56.815 --> 00:01:58.451
♪ CAN'T TRUST YOU
IF I CAN'T ♪

00:01:58.484 --> 00:02:00.486
♪ SEE YOUR FACE
AT NIGHT ♪

00:02:00.519 --> 00:02:02.321
♪ I THINK WE ALL KNOW
WHO WE'RE TALKING ABOUT ♪

00:02:02.354 --> 00:02:03.356
- ALL RIGHT, WAIT. HEY!

00:02:03.389 --> 00:02:05.158
STOP THAT.

00:02:05.191 --> 00:02:06.826
THAT'S RACIST.

00:02:06.859 --> 00:02:08.794
- WHAT'S--WHAT?
WHAT IS RACIST ABOUT IT?

00:02:08.827 --> 00:02:10.930
- "THE ONLY HOOD I LOVE
IS POINTY AND WHITE"?

00:02:10.963 --> 00:02:12.765
- YEAH, MAN.

00:02:12.798 --> 00:02:14.834
- THAT'S TALKING
ABOUT THE KLAN, MAN.

00:02:14.867 --> 00:02:18.804
- THE KU KLUX KLAN?
ARE YOU OUTSIDE OF YOUR MIND?

00:02:18.837 --> 00:02:21.407
THAT'S TRADITIONAL
COUNTRY MUSIC IMAGERY, MAN,

00:02:21.440 --> 00:02:24.277
LIKE A PICKUP TRUCK
OR SLEEPING UNDER THE STARS,

00:02:24.310 --> 00:02:25.678
OR YOUR DOG GOT KILLED
OR YOUR WIFE LEFT YOU.

00:02:25.711 --> 00:02:27.747
SAME THING!

00:02:27.780 --> 00:02:29.715
- I WOULD HAVE BEEN FINE
WITH ANY OF THOSE THINGS.

00:02:29.748 --> 00:02:31.184
- WHAT IS THE DIFFERENCE
BETWEEN THOSE THINGS

00:02:31.217 --> 00:02:32.218
AND WHAT IS IN THE SONG?

00:02:32.251 --> 00:02:34.287
- THEY'RE NOT RACIAL!

00:02:34.320 --> 00:02:35.555
- HEY, YOU KNOW WHAT?
CAN I JUST SAY SOMETHING, MAN?

00:02:35.588 --> 00:02:37.490
I'M JUST GONNA BE FRANK.

00:02:37.523 --> 00:02:39.225
YOU'RE GETTING A LITTLE,
LIKE, AL SHARPTON,

00:02:39.258 --> 00:02:40.927
LIKE, FARRAKHAN
ON ME RIGHT NOW.

00:02:40.960 --> 00:02:43.396
- OH, MY GOD.
ARE YOU SERIOUS?

00:02:43.429 --> 00:02:46.265
- YO, DUDE, DUDE, PLEASE.
HEY, CAN I DO ONE MORE?

00:02:46.298 --> 00:02:48.367
LET ME JUST
DO ONE MORE, DOG.

00:02:48.400 --> 00:02:52.338
I ABSOLUTELY PROMISE YOU
THAT THIS SONG IS NOT RACIST

00:02:52.371 --> 00:02:57.343
AND IT'S IMPOSSIBLE FOR YOU
TO MISINTERPRET IT AS SUCH.

00:02:57.376 --> 00:02:59.278
- OKAY, IT SEEMS LIKE
YOU'RE ABOUT TO SING

00:02:59.311 --> 00:03:00.947
THE MOST RACIST SONG
SO FAR.

00:03:00.980 --> 00:03:04.350
- I'M NOT.

00:03:04.383 --> 00:03:06.652
♪ HIDEY-LIDEY-LIDEY-LEE ♪

00:03:06.685 --> 00:03:08.654
♪ GET ME A ROPE
AND FIND ME A TREE ♪

00:03:08.687 --> 00:03:11.991
- OKAY, I'M OUT.

00:03:12.024 --> 00:03:12.992
- COME ON, MAN. HEY!

00:03:13.025 --> 00:03:15.228
SHOOT.

00:03:15.261 --> 00:03:18.798
I'M OVER HERE TRYING
TO SING ABOUT A TIRE SWING.

00:03:18.831 --> 00:03:21.300
GONNA WRITE OFF
AN ENTIRE GENRE OF MUSIC.

00:03:21.333 --> 00:03:23.502
[playing guitar]

00:03:23.535 --> 00:03:26.439
♪ THE BANJOS ARE STRUMMING,
AND THE DRUMS ARE A-BANGIN' ♪

00:03:26.472 --> 00:03:29.976
♪ LET'S GET THE BOYS TOGETHER
AND HAVE OURSELVES A-HANGIN' ♪

00:03:30.009 --> 00:03:31.978
OH, DAMN.

00:03:32.011 --> 00:03:33.744
NOW I SEE IT.
NOW I SEE IT.

